 },
 "summary": "A three-pole female XLR receptacle in a round plastic body, for rear mounting behind a front panel and horizontal mounting on a PCB. It has no ground or shell contact. A push latch locks the mating plug. Panel cutout and PCB layout are the same as Neutrik's A series, and it fixes to the panel with A screws. Each contact is rated 6 A at under 50 V, over -30 °C to +80 °C.",
